= Nodes and agents: extending the Minecraft world to serve by demand
We will describe a system that we've designed and internally implemented at TTKB-HCMUT to accommodate this need. The system, which we affectionately call "minecluster", is a Distributed Elixir @distex application wrapped in a platform layer so that it is not only a robust distributed system but is also tightly, portably wrapped in a single Windows executable.
